WEBVTT

00:00:42.814 --> 00:00:43.840
[This drama is a work of fiction.]

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:44.871
[Any resemblance to real persons,
places, or events is coincidental.]

00:00:44.871 --> 00:00:45.887
[Scenes with child actors and animals
were filmed safely]

00:00:45.887 --> 00:00:47.215
[under professional supervision.]

00:00:48.278 --> 00:00:50.293
[Episode 3]

00:00:57.482 --> 00:01:00.133
They offered to help me
blow the Oh Kwang Jae case wide open.

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:03.043
So I almost just went ahead and
blew the whole thing wide open, but...

00:01:03.043 --> 00:01:06.588
I'm giving you one last chance.

00:01:12.052 --> 00:01:15.886
[Kwon Se Myeong]

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:37.276
It looks like she's about
to get into another car.

00:01:57.549 --> 00:02:00.168
Got her.

00:02:08.244 --> 00:02:11.397
Kwon Se Myeong.

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:17.894
Prosecutor Bang!

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.084
Miss,

00:02:41.084 --> 00:02:42.924
bring me every fish they have in this place.

00:02:42.924 --> 00:02:46.146
I'm about to keep this place running all night!

00:02:46.146 --> 00:02:48.397
[Chu Sang Ah still in talks with the old man]

00:02:48.397 --> 00:02:50.233
Dear Prosecutor Bang.

00:02:50.233 --> 00:02:52.580
Yes, sir.

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:54.576
I still

00:02:54.576 --> 00:02:59.021
get a real kick out of
how we screwed Lee Yang Mi over.

00:02:59.021 --> 00:03:01.661
You know I didn't grow up in the mud.
I've got a soft heart.

00:03:01.661 --> 00:03:06.210
Then I'll make sure
that heart of yours stays protected.

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:08.075
And this...

00:03:08.075 --> 00:03:11.377
is how I feel about our future.

00:03:11.377 --> 00:03:16.053
Oh man, it's just amazing.
I've never gotten a gift in my life.

00:03:16.053 --> 00:03:19.429
Look at you two.
What is this, the love story of the century?

00:03:19.429 --> 00:03:20.500
Sir,

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:23.614
just polish him up first,
then get him into the presidential campaign.

00:03:23.614 --> 00:03:26.885
Jumping straight to a presidential campaign?

00:03:26.885 --> 00:03:28.030
Alright,

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:30.264
the nomination comes first.

00:03:30.264 --> 00:03:33.343
I'll start from the bottom
and learn step by step.

00:03:33.343 --> 00:03:36.041
We're bringing in a rising star.

00:03:36.041 --> 00:03:37.531
No reason to say no.

00:03:37.531 --> 00:03:39.375
Alright, let's make it happen.

00:03:39.375 --> 00:03:42.888
I'll give it my all.

00:03:46.581 --> 00:03:48.247
Oh, hello.

00:03:48.247 --> 00:03:49.793
This was supposed to be
Prosecutor Bang's setup.

00:03:49.793 --> 00:03:51.524
What took you so long?

00:03:51.524 --> 00:03:53.997
It's been a while, sir.
I look forward to working with you.

00:03:53.997 --> 00:03:56.216
Prosecutor Bang.

00:03:56.216 --> 00:03:59.417
I knew you'd make your move sooner or later.

00:03:59.417 --> 00:04:02.730
- Let's do good work.
- Likewise, sir.

00:04:11.857 --> 00:04:13.535
Hi, I'm here too.

00:04:13.535 --> 00:04:18.156
You know,
I didn't think that snake would tag along.

00:04:18.156 --> 00:04:21.516
Running into someone
from the same household here of all places.

00:04:21.516 --> 00:04:23.618
You must've been in a rush
over this Mayor Nam case,

00:04:23.618 --> 00:04:25.262
showing up somewhere like this.

00:04:25.262 --> 00:04:28.373
You really don't waste any time.

00:04:31.215 --> 00:04:33.132
Stay out of it.

00:04:33.132 --> 00:04:34.829
Wait...

00:04:34.829 --> 00:04:37.793
With this lineup,
I guess sitting together's off the table.

00:04:37.793 --> 00:04:39.337
Normally, yeah...

00:04:39.337 --> 00:04:41.466
but we can make it work today.

00:04:41.466 --> 00:04:43.960
Right?

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:46.212
Right.

00:04:46.212 --> 00:04:48.746
Right.

00:05:02.114 --> 00:05:05.413
Still got that wild streak.

00:05:12.928 --> 00:05:16.814
That's why I always had a soft spot for you.

00:05:17.548 --> 00:05:19.914
Sir,

00:05:19.914 --> 00:05:24.394
this isn't the time to get sentimental.

00:05:24.394 --> 00:05:27.274
Park Jae Sang

00:05:27.274 --> 00:05:30.301
is getting out soon.

00:05:35.315 --> 00:05:37.515
You know

00:05:37.515 --> 00:05:40.785
he has a copy of the Oh Kwang Jae file

00:05:40.785 --> 00:05:43.708
with your name in it.

00:05:46.628 --> 00:05:50.121
If that resurfaces,

00:05:51.348 --> 00:05:55.021
you'll be in deep trouble too.

00:06:01.377 --> 00:06:04.750
My dad's got plenty of sins too.

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:07.745
For a guy who never trusts anyone,

00:06:07.745 --> 00:06:10.184
he got played by some hack fortune teller,

00:06:10.184 --> 00:06:12.755
took in the wrong second wife,

00:06:12.755 --> 00:06:17.183
and made a real mess of the family in the end.

00:06:17.183 --> 00:06:18.608
Darn it.

00:06:18.608 --> 00:06:21.737
Why's he talking like that? So trashy.

00:06:21.737 --> 00:06:23.390
Hey, mutt.

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:26.530
Know your place.

00:06:27.887 --> 00:06:29.965
You run wild every night

00:06:29.965 --> 00:06:31.496
at that secluded Yangpyeong villa,
getting filthy.

00:06:31.496 --> 00:06:33.248
You think you're better than everyone else?

00:06:33.248 --> 00:06:35.614
Cut the crap.

00:06:35.614 --> 00:06:36.751
Director Lee,

00:06:36.751 --> 00:06:39.218
I know you're on edge about Mayor Nam,

00:06:39.218 --> 00:06:40.422
but let's just enjoy tonight.

00:06:40.422 --> 00:06:42.195
Right.

00:06:42.195 --> 00:06:46.265
Tonight is for Prosecutor Bang.

00:06:46.265 --> 00:06:48.205
Oh, right.

00:06:48.205 --> 00:06:52.052
I should start calling him Assemblyman Bang.

00:06:52.052 --> 00:06:54.769
What is this vibe?

00:06:54.769 --> 00:06:57.535
You're giving Bang Tae Seop the nomination?

00:06:57.535 --> 00:06:58.836
You know...

00:06:58.836 --> 00:07:00.919
I just did what needed to be done.

00:07:00.919 --> 00:07:03.570
But if I'm offered the nomination,
I'd be honored to accept.

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:07.049
Come on, we'd be the honored ones.

00:07:07.049 --> 00:07:08.241
Thank you.

00:07:08.241 --> 00:07:09.663
Alright, cheers.

00:07:09.663 --> 00:07:12.096
Thank you.

00:07:46.849 --> 00:07:49.702
Bang Tae Seop.

00:07:49.702 --> 00:07:53.342
You know what celebrities
and politicians have in common?

00:07:53.342 --> 00:07:55.106
They live and die by their image.

00:07:55.106 --> 00:07:58.739
Which means they can be torn down in public.

00:07:59.927 --> 00:08:05.153
And that just happens to be my specialty.

00:08:07.223 --> 00:08:10.444
You made a big mistake.

00:08:13.163 --> 00:08:18.136
Before long,
you'll be begging me for forgiveness.

00:08:25.825 --> 00:08:28.112
Lee Yang Mi.

00:08:28.112 --> 00:08:30.962
This is just the beginning.

00:08:30.962 --> 00:08:36.059
Once I get my teeth into someone
with as much to lose as you...

00:08:36.059 --> 00:08:38.965
Yeah, we'll see

00:08:41.419 --> 00:08:44.014
how far I take it.

00:08:45.016 --> 00:08:47.507
Your little love story alone is

00:08:47.507 --> 00:08:52.054
more than enough ammo for someone like me.

00:09:06.892 --> 00:09:10.992
I was debating whether to tell you...

00:09:10.992 --> 00:09:15.977
That tax scandal that blew up
when Chu Sang Ah fought her old agency.

00:09:15.977 --> 00:09:19.110
That was me.

00:09:20.799 --> 00:09:21.916
What are you talking about?

00:09:21.916 --> 00:09:26.675
She was getting way too cocky,
hiding behind Chairman Kwon.

00:09:26.675 --> 00:09:30.208
So I lined up a few reporters
and made sure she got a taste of reality.

00:09:30.208 --> 00:09:33.165
That's how I operate.

00:09:33.165 --> 00:09:35.611
Got it?

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:39.851
Do you even know what that put Sang Ah through?

00:09:39.851 --> 00:09:43.037
That was the point. Not my problem.

00:09:44.096 --> 00:09:46.595
Driver Kang.

00:09:49.542 --> 00:09:52.113
And that Oh Kwang Jae case you had lined up.

00:09:52.113 --> 00:09:55.060
I'm kicking that project into gear.

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:58.779
Big budget, so... stay tuned.

00:10:07.837 --> 00:10:09.490
Lee Yang Mi.

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:11.382
I don't know what game you're playing,

00:10:11.382 --> 00:10:13.343
but I was in charge of that case.

00:10:13.343 --> 00:10:16.722
Chu Sang Ah is clean.

00:10:18.696 --> 00:10:20.953
You still don't know

00:10:20.953 --> 00:10:25.599
what Chu Sang Ah really looks like.

00:10:39.698 --> 00:10:42.498
Chu Sang Ah.

00:10:43.091 --> 00:10:47.271
You didn't have to go that far back then.

00:10:50.674 --> 00:10:55.708
Looks like you're here
to have Park Jae Sang silenced.

00:10:56.637 --> 00:11:01.703
But I'm past the point of losing sleep
over a piece of paper like that.

00:11:02.844 --> 00:11:05.257
You, on the other hand...

00:11:05.257 --> 00:11:07.661
with blood on your hands,

00:11:07.661 --> 00:11:10.674
that's a different story.

00:11:14.706 --> 00:11:17.172
Sir...

00:11:19.909 --> 00:11:23.288
You're coming to me for this?

00:11:25.006 --> 00:11:28.926
You should be taking a hard look
at your husband first.

00:11:33.264 --> 00:11:36.264
What are you talking about?

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:50.524
How far do you trust Bang Tae Seop?

00:13:30.083 --> 00:13:31.791
2018.

00:13:31.791 --> 00:13:34.597
The Oh Kwang Jae murder at Seogwang Hotel.

00:13:34.597 --> 00:13:35.790
[Choi Ji Ho's Fact Check]

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:39.375
I first got interested in this case
because of Chu Sang Ah.

00:13:39.375 --> 00:13:42.150
But I really started digging

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:44.630
after I saw a photo of Park Jae Sang,

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:47.087
who was arrested as the prime suspect.

00:13:47.087 --> 00:13:48.550
[Connection, Contract killing, Confession]
Alright.

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:52.801
For those of you who aren't familiar
with the Oh Kwang Jae case...

00:13:52.801 --> 00:13:54.611
[The Oh Kwang Jae Murder Case]
[Three Lives, Tightly Entangled]

00:13:54.611 --> 00:13:55.974
[Why Was the Actress Named?]

00:13:55.974 --> 00:13:59.888
[Chu Sang Ah hires her bodyguard,
Park Jae Sang, to carry out the hit]

00:13:59.888 --> 00:14:01.745
[Admits to killing agency CEO Oh Kwang Jae]

00:14:01.745 --> 00:14:03.452
[What was their relationship?]

00:14:03.452 --> 00:14:04.528
[Oh Kwang Jae & Chu Sang Ah Interview]
[A radiant smile]

00:14:04.528 --> 00:14:08.598
Who was Oh Kwang Jae,

00:14:08.598 --> 00:14:12.485
[Korea's reigning romance queen]
the man who made top star Chu Sang Ah

00:14:12.485 --> 00:14:15.503
[Let's meet the hottest star, Sang Ah]
and ended up the victim of this brutal murder?

00:14:15.503 --> 00:14:17.013
[Who is Oh Kwang Jae?]
Oh Kwang Jae was

00:14:17.013 --> 00:14:21.483
a powerhouse in Korean cinema,
known as the Midas touch of Chungmuro.

00:14:21.483 --> 00:14:24.010
She's got that natural star quality
and the grit to back it up.

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:28.097
I knew she'd go beyond Korea
and become a global star.

00:14:28.097 --> 00:14:33.287
He's especially known as the producer
who turned Chu Sang Ah into a top star.

00:14:33.287 --> 00:14:35.521
[The man who made her who she is today]

00:14:35.521 --> 00:14:36.835
But just

00:14:36.835 --> 00:14:40.271
as he was about to take a major leap
through a partnership with WR Group,

00:14:40.271 --> 00:14:41.824
he was suddenly murdered.

00:14:41.824 --> 00:14:43.717
[The Oh Kwang Jae Murder Case]

00:14:43.717 --> 00:14:47.485
The killer was Park Jae Sang,
Chu Sang Ah's bodyguard.

00:14:47.485 --> 00:14:50.835
A brutal, cold-blooded murder.
Oh Kwang Jae was killed by Park Jae Sang.

00:14:50.835 --> 00:14:53.240
This man right here

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:57.609
is Park Jae Sang,
who was arrested as the suspect at the time.

00:14:57.609 --> 00:14:59.633
I mean...

00:14:59.633 --> 00:15:03.013
he doesn't exactly look like someone
who could hurt a fly.

00:15:03.013 --> 00:15:04.830
It got me curious.

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:09.134
How did someone like him end up the suspect
in such a brutal murder?

00:15:09.134 --> 00:15:09.996
[The Oh Kwang Jae Murder Case]

00:15:09.996 --> 00:15:11.894
So who turned

00:15:11.894 --> 00:15:17.507
this gentle guy's world upside down?

00:15:20.904 --> 00:15:23.064
But then...

00:15:23.064 --> 00:15:26.175
all the case files, the articles.

00:15:26.175 --> 00:15:28.332
Every last one of them just vanished.

00:15:28.332 --> 00:15:29.412
[Page Not Found]

00:15:29.412 --> 00:15:31.044
[The Oh Kwang Jae Murder Case]

00:15:31.044 --> 00:15:32.768
[No results found for
"The Oh Kwang Jae Murder Case"]

00:15:32.768 --> 00:15:36.308
Raises a pretty obvious question, doesn't it?

00:15:37.734 --> 00:15:40.860
There's someone behind this.

00:15:47.804 --> 00:15:50.642
So I started digging deeper.

00:15:50.642 --> 00:15:54.362
[Did Chu Sang Ah not know?
No, she was always at the center of it]

00:16:00.085 --> 00:16:03.239
Then one day,

00:16:03.239 --> 00:16:06.025
it hit me.

00:16:08.286 --> 00:16:11.639
What if I go beyond the gossip...

00:16:11.639 --> 00:16:14.655
and find something more direct?

00:16:14.655 --> 00:16:16.685
So I

00:16:16.685 --> 00:16:19.822
went straight to the prison.

00:16:19.822 --> 00:16:22.350
To meet Park Jae Sang.

00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:25.116
It's fine. I'll just come back.

00:16:25.116 --> 00:16:27.887
Man... came all this way.

00:16:27.887 --> 00:16:29.504
[Cheongseong Penitentiary]
See you next time.

00:16:29.504 --> 00:16:30.855
He wouldn't see me.

00:16:30.855 --> 00:16:34.055
So I kept going back. Again and again.

00:16:34.055 --> 00:16:39.004
And then one day, he reached out first.
Said he'd meet me.

00:16:39.004 --> 00:16:41.911
Cheongseong Penitentiary.

00:16:43.197 --> 00:16:44.928
Look at this.

00:16:44.928 --> 00:16:47.034
Creepy, right?

00:16:47.034 --> 00:16:49.147
[Cheongseong Penitentiary]

00:17:02.962 --> 00:17:05.094
Hello, Mr. Park Jae Sang.

00:17:05.094 --> 00:17:09.000
He looked just like his photo. Real harmless.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:11.383
He wouldn't say why he wanted to meet.

00:17:11.383 --> 00:17:14.895
I figured there had to be a reason,
so I waited.

00:17:14.895 --> 00:17:18.529
Then, right before his release...

00:17:18.529 --> 00:17:23.075
He told me something shocking.

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:27.530
After Han Ji Soo died,

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:30.960
Chu Sang Ah refused to shoot
and started spiraling.

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:35.193
So Oh Kwang Jae put me on her security detail.

00:17:35.193 --> 00:17:38.006
That's how we met.

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:42.876
I had no idea it would end up like this...

00:17:48.806 --> 00:17:51.976
I'll tell you the rest once I'm out.

00:17:51.976 --> 00:17:55.183
Chu Sang Ah, and Park Jae Sang...

00:17:55.183 --> 00:18:00.023
The shocking truth behind it all.

00:18:03.592 --> 00:18:06.385
Next time.

00:18:07.572 --> 00:18:09.809
Next time,

00:18:09.809 --> 00:18:13.739
we'll have Park Jae Sang here with us,
in person.

00:18:13.739 --> 00:18:19.579
We'll get into the truth behind all of this.

00:18:19.579 --> 00:18:21.732
Bye!

00:19:05.155 --> 00:19:07.528
I got this.

00:19:28.405 --> 00:19:31.672
Let's go, 500 calories!
Get those legs up higher!

00:19:31.672 --> 00:19:35.708
Now let go and jump with your arms out!

00:19:36.349 --> 00:19:38.616
- You got this!
- I can't!

00:19:38.616 --> 00:19:40.576
Good, grab on again.

00:19:40.576 --> 00:19:43.997
Take it easy. You're pushing me too hard!

00:19:48.265 --> 00:19:51.284
Let's call it here for today.

00:19:57.716 --> 00:20:00.721
Park Jae Sang gets out today,
so I'm on my way to pick him up.

00:20:00.721 --> 00:20:04.351
I'll get the recording as soon as I see him.

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:09.447
I watched your last episode.

00:20:09.447 --> 00:20:12.239
It felt a little slow.

00:20:12.239 --> 00:20:16.530
The pacing is loose. It really drags.

00:20:16.530 --> 00:20:18.531
Everyone's watching shorts these days.

00:20:18.531 --> 00:20:22.535
If you go all artsy like a European film,
we're dead in the water.

00:20:22.535 --> 00:20:26.123
I'll push him harder this time.

00:20:26.851 --> 00:20:28.521
Still...

00:20:28.521 --> 00:20:30.808
must be nice having money behind you.

00:20:30.808 --> 00:20:32.685
The quality's definitely improved.

00:20:32.685 --> 00:20:36.972
Maybe let's call it dedication, not money.

00:20:36.972 --> 00:20:38.442
Sure.

00:20:38.442 --> 00:20:42.284
Then show me more of that dedication.

00:20:46.086 --> 00:20:48.064
That's Park Jae Sang's booking fee.

00:20:48.064 --> 00:20:50.832
By the way, is he still hung up on her?

00:20:50.832 --> 00:20:53.683
Selling out Chu Sang Ah's recording this cheap?

00:20:53.683 --> 00:20:56.116
He's probably

00:20:56.116 --> 00:20:57.600
blinded by revenge

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:00.400
more than money.

00:21:02.464 --> 00:21:04.969
Nice line.

00:21:04.969 --> 00:21:06.245
See,

00:21:06.245 --> 00:21:10.830
I may not trust you,
but I trust that mouth of yours.

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:12.857
Thank you.

00:21:12.857 --> 00:21:15.343
You can go now.

00:21:29.737 --> 00:21:32.354
Choi Ji Ho's on the move.
You're not in position yet?

00:21:32.354 --> 00:21:35.233
Buy me a little more time.

00:21:36.754 --> 00:21:40.948
- Too many eyes around. Got held up.
- Darn it.

00:21:59.227 --> 00:22:01.030
Three minutes.

00:22:01.030 --> 00:22:03.226
Got it.

00:22:06.096 --> 00:22:08.642
Oh my!

00:22:13.842 --> 00:22:17.358
What do I do... I'm so sorry. Are you okay?

00:22:17.358 --> 00:22:19.318
I-It's fine.

00:22:19.318 --> 00:22:21.905
Wait.

00:22:25.918 --> 00:22:28.298
This is

00:22:28.298 --> 00:22:30.371
really expensive, isn't it?

00:22:30.371 --> 00:22:32.084
Sorry?

00:22:32.084 --> 00:22:36.322
I got the same brand for a friend once,

00:22:36.322 --> 00:22:38.709
so I can tell.

00:22:38.709 --> 00:22:40.631
I said it's fine.

00:22:40.631 --> 00:22:42.744
Really, it's fine.

00:22:44.928 --> 00:22:47.521
Wait...

00:22:48.461 --> 00:22:51.688
Haven't we met somewhere before?

00:22:53.255 --> 00:22:56.925
Well, I'm a fairly well-known figure,

00:22:56.925 --> 00:22:58.782
so that's probably it.

00:22:58.782 --> 00:23:01.058
I see.

00:23:07.910 --> 00:23:10.629
Mission complete.

00:23:17.501 --> 00:23:19.740
Hey.

00:23:23.577 --> 00:23:26.077
You are

00:23:27.182 --> 00:23:29.610
a well-known leech.

00:23:32.489 --> 00:23:35.829
What did you just say?

00:23:36.595 --> 00:23:40.482
Keep feeding off

00:23:40.482 --> 00:23:43.727
other people's lives like that,

00:23:43.727 --> 00:23:47.153
it'll come back around and bite you.

00:23:56.013 --> 00:23:58.300
Who are you?

00:23:58.300 --> 00:24:00.266
See you around,

00:24:00.266 --> 00:24:02.939
leech.

00:24:02.939 --> 00:24:05.878
Doors closing.

00:24:17.292 --> 00:24:19.295
We need to grab that bastard Choi Ji Ho

00:24:19.295 --> 00:24:21.815
before he gets his hands on the recording.

00:24:21.815 --> 00:24:24.779
I planted a tracker on his car.

00:24:24.779 --> 00:24:29.106
Looks like he just met Lee Yang Mi
and is heading to pick up Park Jae Sang.

00:24:29.106 --> 00:24:33.622
I'll stay on him. I'll call you.

00:25:01.948 --> 00:25:04.642
Sir...

00:25:04.642 --> 00:25:08.654
Your disciplinary hearing's been called in.

00:25:11.815 --> 00:25:14.342
About time.

00:25:14.342 --> 00:25:15.962
Sorry?

00:25:15.962 --> 00:25:18.422
They took long enough.

00:25:18.422 --> 00:25:20.667
I knew he was trouble,

00:25:20.667 --> 00:25:23.507
but trying to make himself a star?

00:25:23.507 --> 00:25:26.833
How dare he go after
the Chief Prosecutor's in-laws...

00:25:28.005 --> 00:25:29.470
My apologies, sir.

00:25:29.470 --> 00:25:30.592
Chief Prosecutor,

00:25:30.592 --> 00:25:33.100
if we apply a violation of
the Prosecutor Ethics Code,

00:25:33.100 --> 00:25:36.979
we can go as far as suspension.

00:25:36.979 --> 00:25:38.490
Do it.

00:25:38.490 --> 00:25:42.666
Suspend Bang Tae Seop effective immediately.

00:25:44.071 --> 00:25:45.561
How's everyone doing?

00:25:45.561 --> 00:25:47.982
Sorry I'm late to my own show.

00:25:47.982 --> 00:25:51.193
How dare...

00:25:51.193 --> 00:25:54.511
When I was loyal to the organization,
I didn't even get a mention.

00:25:54.511 --> 00:25:56.708
Now I slip up once,

00:25:56.708 --> 00:25:58.758
and you all throw a party in my name.

00:25:58.758 --> 00:26:01.964
- I'm honored.
- Hey, Tae Seop.

00:26:05.929 --> 00:26:08.493
I'm the one who dragged all of you
into this room,

00:26:08.493 --> 00:26:12.183
so if I'm getting suspended,
you should be right there with me.

00:26:12.183 --> 00:26:14.674
Director Byun, then...

00:26:14.674 --> 00:26:16.758
Should we start with the Samgwang Hotel case?

00:26:16.758 --> 00:26:18.934
You little...

00:26:19.900 --> 00:26:21.083
So,

00:26:21.083 --> 00:26:26.043
I'll have to decline your suspension.

00:26:29.042 --> 00:26:31.113
This rotten organization?

00:26:31.113 --> 00:26:32.813
I'm walking out

00:26:32.813 --> 00:26:35.106
[Letter of Resignation]
on my own.

00:26:35.106 --> 00:26:36.897
Has he lost his mind?

00:26:36.897 --> 00:26:38.330
Goodbye.

00:26:38.330 --> 00:26:39.560
Bye.

00:26:39.560 --> 00:26:41.287
Hey, Tae Seop.

00:26:41.287 --> 00:26:43.100
Hey!

00:26:43.100 --> 00:26:44.958
Bang Tae Seop!

00:26:44.958 --> 00:26:46.335
You little punk...

00:26:46.335 --> 00:26:47.922
Hey!

00:26:47.922 --> 00:26:52.567
You're just going to blow this up
and walk away?

00:26:57.894 --> 00:27:00.613
Tae Seop...

00:27:00.613 --> 00:27:03.431
The stuff I told you to hide...

00:27:03.431 --> 00:27:06.838
that stays buried, right?

00:27:06.838 --> 00:27:08.555
Hard to say.

00:27:08.555 --> 00:27:11.852
I might be giving you a call down the line.

00:27:11.852 --> 00:27:14.370
You can settle what you owe me then.

00:27:14.370 --> 00:27:16.543
I'm off.

00:27:18.504 --> 00:27:21.017
Darn it.

00:27:30.253 --> 00:27:32.455
[Mayor Nam Hye Hoon Holds
Emergency Press Conference]

00:27:32.455 --> 00:27:35.008
[Mayor Nam Emergency Press Conference]

00:27:35.008 --> 00:27:39.222
[Nam Hye Hoon Admits to Sex Bribery]
[Resigns as Mayor of Seoam]

00:27:43.002 --> 00:27:45.375
Nice.

00:27:51.538 --> 00:27:54.284
There he is!

00:28:00.826 --> 00:28:02.595
Are you stepping down from the prosecution?

00:28:02.595 --> 00:28:03.912
Were you under internal pressure?

00:28:03.912 --> 00:28:07.585
Mayor Nam just resigned.
As the whistleblower, how do you feel?

00:28:07.585 --> 00:28:11.278
What are your plans going forward?

00:28:12.504 --> 00:28:14.798
I'm being forced out for exposing corruption
within the organization,

00:28:14.798 --> 00:28:16.346
so as of today,

00:28:16.346 --> 00:28:20.535
I'm stepping down as a prosecutor.

00:28:20.535 --> 00:28:22.514
But here and now,

00:28:22.514 --> 00:28:26.419
I'd like to announce a new beginning.

00:28:26.419 --> 00:28:27.950
I, Bang Tae Seop,

00:28:27.950 --> 00:28:29.669
will be entering

00:28:29.669 --> 00:28:32.341
this general election

00:28:32.341 --> 00:28:35.693
as Changjo Party's first recruited candidate.

00:28:35.693 --> 00:28:37.910
No matter what challenges come my way,

00:28:37.910 --> 00:28:40.239
I will stand firm,

00:28:40.239 --> 00:28:43.056
never bow to power,

00:28:43.056 --> 00:28:48.067
and serve only the people.

00:28:48.067 --> 00:28:49.784
Thank you.

00:28:49.784 --> 00:28:51.168
One more comment, please!

00:28:51.168 --> 00:28:53.537
Did you always plan to go into politics?
Please answer.

00:28:53.537 --> 00:28:55.341
When will you officially begin your campaign?

00:28:55.341 --> 00:28:57.438
Please respond.

00:28:57.438 --> 00:28:59.614
Is that true?

00:29:02.726 --> 00:29:04.291
Over here, please!

00:29:04.291 --> 00:29:06.714
Please answer!

00:29:16.266 --> 00:29:18.542
First of all,

00:29:18.542 --> 00:29:21.392
I apologize for the disruption.

00:29:21.392 --> 00:29:23.835
I'm sorry.

00:29:25.066 --> 00:29:28.476
It's not her fault, but still,

00:29:28.476 --> 00:29:32.877
with the shoot getting canceled and delayed,

00:29:32.877 --> 00:29:36.453
the losses are significant.

00:29:36.453 --> 00:29:39.577
We really have no excuse.

00:29:39.577 --> 00:29:42.377
But this film is

00:29:43.630 --> 00:29:45.994
her comeback project,

00:29:45.994 --> 00:29:48.294
so you know

00:29:48.294 --> 00:29:52.924
how important it is to both of us.

00:29:52.924 --> 00:29:55.622
- Maybe we can have some dinner...
- I'll cover...

00:29:55.622 --> 00:29:59.175
the additional production costs within reason.

00:30:00.762 --> 00:30:05.162
What matters most is
finishing the film properly.

00:30:05.162 --> 00:30:08.852
As for the delays from the canceled shoot,

00:30:08.852 --> 00:30:11.602
let's discuss compensation separately.

00:30:12.719 --> 00:30:17.219
She is willing to go this far,

00:30:17.219 --> 00:30:18.952
so I hope you can ease up a bit.

00:30:18.952 --> 00:30:21.872
You can go over the details with him.

00:30:21.872 --> 00:30:23.974
I need to take this.

00:30:23.974 --> 00:30:25.011
Okay.

00:30:25.011 --> 00:30:28.809
Let's step outside and talk specifics.

00:30:45.421 --> 00:30:47.178
I'm out.

00:30:47.178 --> 00:30:49.354
Where should we meet?

00:30:49.354 --> 00:30:51.674
Jae Sang,

00:30:52.548 --> 00:30:55.914
today is not a good time.

00:30:55.914 --> 00:30:58.491
I told you this was your last chance.

00:30:58.491 --> 00:31:00.698
Why do you keep making me out

00:31:00.698 --> 00:31:03.474
to be the bad guy?

00:31:03.474 --> 00:31:07.262
You're the one who pushed me here.

00:31:07.262 --> 00:31:10.350
I didn't want this.

00:31:11.745 --> 00:31:14.671
Chu Sang Ah.

00:31:14.671 --> 00:31:16.404
You really

00:31:16.404 --> 00:31:19.710
want to see how far I'll take this?

00:31:20.904 --> 00:31:25.690
I just can't leave right now.

00:31:25.690 --> 00:31:29.450
You said if I killed Oh Kwang Jae,
you'd be with me.

00:31:29.450 --> 00:31:34.029
That you'd leave Bang Tae Seop...
Was all of that a lie?

00:31:34.029 --> 00:31:37.236
No.

00:31:37.236 --> 00:31:40.282
I meant it back then.

00:31:41.662 --> 00:31:44.349
You know

00:31:45.182 --> 00:31:47.596
I can't do that anymore.

00:31:47.596 --> 00:31:48.966
No.

00:31:48.966 --> 00:31:52.453
I'm not letting you go.

00:31:52.453 --> 00:31:54.851
You wreck my life,
and live with some other guy...

00:31:54.851 --> 00:31:58.684
and I'm just supposed to sit back and watch?

00:31:58.684 --> 00:32:01.478
Not happening.

00:32:01.478 --> 00:32:04.011
So come to me.

00:32:04.011 --> 00:32:06.871
Keep your promise to me.

00:32:06.871 --> 00:32:09.615
Or I'll take this all the way.

00:32:09.615 --> 00:32:11.779
I'll expose everything, recordings and all.

00:32:11.779 --> 00:32:14.952
I'll show the whole country

00:32:15.675 --> 00:32:18.655
what kind of monster you are.

00:32:18.655 --> 00:32:21.459
And I'll blow that fake marriage to pieces...

00:32:21.459 --> 00:32:25.079
then take you down with me.

00:32:25.079 --> 00:32:27.401
Just watch.

00:33:09.383 --> 00:33:11.636
I may be leaving the organization,

00:33:11.636 --> 00:33:13.388
but if this has helped expose
not just the prosecution,

00:33:13.388 --> 00:33:16.511
but the truth of how our system really works,

00:33:16.511 --> 00:33:19.235
then I've done my part.

00:33:19.235 --> 00:33:20.865
Mr. Bang Tae Seop,

00:33:20.865 --> 00:33:22.959
thank you for your candid remarks.

00:33:22.959 --> 00:33:25.576
You've announced a new beginning today,

00:33:25.576 --> 00:33:27.900
and we look forward to what's ahead.

00:33:27.900 --> 00:33:30.400
Thank you.

00:33:31.273 --> 00:33:34.597
I approached this
as if I were stepping off a cliff.

00:33:34.597 --> 00:33:36.647
And I'll keep fighting injustice,

00:33:36.647 --> 00:33:40.414
to repay the support and trust you've shown me.

00:33:40.414 --> 00:33:42.960
Thank you.

00:34:03.201 --> 00:34:06.957
[246-17 Huichang-dong, Gangseo-gu]

00:34:23.909 --> 00:34:26.295
You've been through a lot.

00:34:26.295 --> 00:34:29.208
Thanks to you, we're off to a good start.

00:34:31.802 --> 00:34:34.602
Mind if I take a look?

00:34:47.112 --> 00:34:49.739
Well...

00:34:49.739 --> 00:34:52.952
How are you planning to release this?

00:34:52.952 --> 00:34:54.463
What do you mean?

00:34:54.463 --> 00:34:57.725
Are you putting all of it out there?

00:35:01.127 --> 00:35:04.466
You're still a softie.

00:35:08.464 --> 00:35:12.011
Still hung up on Chu Sang Ah?

00:35:14.444 --> 00:35:18.030
She was my first love.

00:35:18.030 --> 00:35:20.310
Alright.

00:35:22.989 --> 00:35:24.592
Think of it this way.

00:35:24.592 --> 00:35:26.616
Even the best ingredients

00:35:26.616 --> 00:35:29.200
depend on who's handling them.

00:35:29.200 --> 00:35:31.141
They can turn into something great,

00:35:31.141 --> 00:35:33.900
something forgettable...

00:35:33.900 --> 00:35:36.520
or complete trash.

00:35:37.928 --> 00:35:42.275
Chu Sang Ah will come back to you.

00:35:42.275 --> 00:35:45.501
I'll handle the recording.

00:35:47.541 --> 00:35:50.381
I know what you're worried about.

00:35:50.381 --> 00:35:53.834
But I know what you want even better.

00:35:54.809 --> 00:35:57.943
I'll make sure you get it.

00:35:57.943 --> 00:36:00.829
Just trust me this once.

00:36:20.981 --> 00:36:23.561
Here it is.

00:36:41.458 --> 00:36:45.657
Feels like something that's been buried
is finally coming back to life.

00:37:03.941 --> 00:37:05.933
I

00:37:06.561 --> 00:37:09.520
want to be your woman.

00:37:12.103 --> 00:37:15.255
I'll give you everything.

00:37:16.858 --> 00:37:19.658
So... Jae Sang.

00:37:38.089 --> 00:37:40.824
[The real killer behind the Oh Kwang Jae case]

00:37:40.824 --> 00:37:42.414
[is Chu Sang Ah]

00:37:57.724 --> 00:38:00.018
Bang Tae Seop?

00:38:15.982 --> 00:38:18.487
What are you doing?

00:38:31.331 --> 00:38:34.169
Hey, leech.

00:38:35.858 --> 00:38:38.445
What the hell are you?

00:38:52.135 --> 00:38:54.201
Let go!

00:38:55.108 --> 00:38:56.405
Bang Tae Seop!

00:38:56.405 --> 00:38:58.614
Bang Tae Seop!

00:39:03.235 --> 00:39:05.015
Hey.

00:39:05.015 --> 00:39:07.132
Take one more step,

00:39:07.132 --> 00:39:09.622
and you're dead.

00:39:09.622 --> 00:39:13.252
You really think you can say that,
knowing who Chu Sang Ah really is?

00:39:13.252 --> 00:39:15.064
You think you know her...

00:39:15.064 --> 00:39:17.063
What,

00:39:17.063 --> 00:39:20.296
that she asked you to kill Oh Kwang Jae?

00:39:20.296 --> 00:39:21.839
So what?

00:39:21.839 --> 00:39:25.615
What's the problem, huh?

00:39:25.615 --> 00:39:28.393
You already knew...

00:39:28.393 --> 00:39:31.968
You knew she put me up to it,
and you threw a murder charge on me?

00:39:31.968 --> 00:39:33.239
Hey!

00:39:33.239 --> 00:39:37.286
Whatever you and Sang Ah had going on,

00:39:37.286 --> 00:39:39.524
you were the one holding the knife.

00:39:39.524 --> 00:39:42.423
And you paid for it. Got it?

00:39:42.423 --> 00:39:43.611
Fine!

00:39:43.611 --> 00:39:47.150
Then let's both go down.

00:39:47.150 --> 00:39:51.130
I'll tear you both apart.

00:39:54.867 --> 00:39:56.352
Go ahead.

00:39:56.352 --> 00:39:58.467
Put it out there.

00:39:58.467 --> 00:40:01.114
Did you forget I'm a prosecutor?

00:40:01.114 --> 00:40:03.205
You release that,

00:40:03.205 --> 00:40:07.828
and you rot in prison for life.

00:40:07.828 --> 00:40:10.035
No.

00:41:03.333 --> 00:41:06.323
Seven years ago, the Oh Kwang Jae murder case.

00:41:06.323 --> 00:41:10.269
The one who ordered
the killing was Chu Sang Ah.

00:41:12.180 --> 00:41:14.858
The prosecutor who buried the case

00:41:14.858 --> 00:41:16.971
is her now-husband, Bang Tae Seop.

00:41:16.971 --> 00:41:20.692
[Oh Kwang Jae's Entertainment List]
[Chu Sang Ah, Investor Kwon Se Myeong]

00:41:22.005 --> 00:41:25.457
Before we go back through this couple's past,

00:41:25.457 --> 00:41:27.946
[China Expansion & Investment Signing Ceremony]

00:41:29.036 --> 00:41:32.749
there's someone you need to know

00:41:32.749 --> 00:41:36.215
to understand what really happened.

00:41:49.422 --> 00:41:52.162
Actress Han Ji Soo.

00:41:57.332 --> 00:41:58.890
A lot of you

00:41:58.890 --> 00:42:01.093
[Choi Ji Ho's Fact Check]
have been waiting for this,

00:42:01.093 --> 00:42:03.583
and it's something
I've been working on for years,

00:42:03.583 --> 00:42:07.078
so this episode will be split into two parts.

00:42:08.690 --> 00:42:11.047
First,

00:42:11.047 --> 00:42:16.680
let's take a look at Han Ji Soo,
a key figure in the case.

00:42:50.841 --> 00:42:51.865
Cut.

00:42:51.865 --> 00:42:54.525
What was that?

00:42:56.712 --> 00:42:59.499
No, wait...

00:42:59.499 --> 00:43:02.405
I'm sorry.

00:43:17.229 --> 00:43:20.822
Don't try to slide this past me.

00:43:20.822 --> 00:43:23.826
If you want Sung Yu Mi, bring me Kim Won Bin.

00:43:23.826 --> 00:43:28.479
That's how you make a deal, alright?

00:43:28.479 --> 00:43:30.483
Tell your director this.

00:43:30.483 --> 00:43:32.203
If he keeps this up,

00:43:32.203 --> 00:43:36.150
I'll wipe their actors off the board.

00:43:36.150 --> 00:43:40.723
I've got a situation on set.
I'll call you later.

00:43:40.723 --> 00:43:42.880
Hello, sir.

00:43:42.880 --> 00:43:44.807
I should've handled Ji Soo better.

00:43:44.807 --> 00:43:47.411
I'm really sorry you had to come
all the way out here.

00:43:47.411 --> 00:43:49.108
At this rate,

00:43:49.108 --> 00:43:52.914
where do you think we can even use Han Ji Soo?

00:44:01.357 --> 00:44:03.381
Where's Ji Soo?

00:44:03.381 --> 00:44:05.060
[Sang Ah]

00:44:06.284 --> 00:44:11.100
Please... please just pick up.

00:44:11.100 --> 00:44:13.397
Ji Soo! Han Ji Soo!

00:44:13.397 --> 00:44:16.070
Open the door.

00:44:16.070 --> 00:44:18.033
I said I'm not filming!

00:44:18.033 --> 00:44:21.011
Hey, CEO Oh is here!

00:44:26.745 --> 00:44:28.998
Sir...

00:44:28.998 --> 00:44:33.371
Ji Soo, are you okay?

00:44:40.174 --> 00:44:44.014
What is it? What's the problem?

00:44:48.662 --> 00:44:50.945
Sir.

00:44:50.945 --> 00:44:53.344
Why is there another bed scene

00:44:53.344 --> 00:44:56.144
that wasn't in the script?

00:44:58.186 --> 00:44:59.969
Money. That's all.

00:44:59.969 --> 00:45:03.453
That's what people want.

00:45:03.453 --> 00:45:05.797
I can't do this anymore.

00:45:05.797 --> 00:45:08.441
I'm seeing a psychiatrist, I can't sleep...

00:45:08.441 --> 00:45:12.101
At this rate, I feel like I'm going to die.

00:45:15.885 --> 00:45:18.685
I feel like dying too.

00:45:19.352 --> 00:45:21.509
But a deal's a deal.

00:45:21.509 --> 00:45:24.309
You signed, you shoot.

00:45:26.431 --> 00:45:27.855
But...

00:45:27.855 --> 00:45:29.531
Ji Soo.

00:45:29.531 --> 00:45:32.921
You know why we stamp contracts in red?

00:45:32.921 --> 00:45:35.867
It means it's written in blood.

00:45:35.867 --> 00:45:38.629
Unless you're dead
and there's a death certificate,

00:45:38.629 --> 00:45:42.088
you finish what you signed.

00:45:44.752 --> 00:45:46.796
This

00:45:46.796 --> 00:45:50.088
could go to court.

00:46:02.615 --> 00:46:07.517
- Please!
- Alright! She's in the zone. Let's roll.

00:46:07.517 --> 00:46:09.871
Where's Kim Jae Won? Get him in here.

00:46:09.871 --> 00:46:12.391
Camera up!

00:46:17.336 --> 00:46:20.309
What are you doing? Get in position.

00:46:24.283 --> 00:46:28.281
Do you have any idea how much money
we're burning while you stall?

00:46:28.281 --> 00:46:31.454
Earn your keep.

00:46:39.631 --> 00:46:41.488
Mr. Oh Kwang Jae!

00:46:41.488 --> 00:46:43.438
Sang Ah.

00:46:43.438 --> 00:46:45.531
Sir.

00:46:45.531 --> 00:46:49.182
You're still pulling this kind of crap?

00:46:49.182 --> 00:46:52.212
Before I expose everything you've pulled

00:46:52.212 --> 00:46:56.069
and get you blacklisted from this industry,

00:46:56.069 --> 00:46:59.235
you'd better straighten yourself out.

00:46:59.976 --> 00:47:01.986
Ji Soo.

00:47:01.986 --> 00:47:03.634
- Are you okay?
- Chu Sang Ah.

00:47:03.634 --> 00:47:06.960
What do you think you're doing?

00:47:06.960 --> 00:47:10.197
I've had enough of your little tantrums.

00:47:10.197 --> 00:47:12.221
Step away.

00:47:12.221 --> 00:47:14.945
She's done with this film, starting today.

00:47:14.945 --> 00:47:16.531
Send over the contract.

00:47:16.531 --> 00:47:19.484
I'll cover the penalty.

00:47:27.786 --> 00:47:30.067
[Oh Kwang Jae]

00:47:52.531 --> 00:47:55.134
Don't take any calls.

00:47:55.134 --> 00:47:58.529
Stay here for a while.

00:47:58.529 --> 00:48:03.202
I'll talk to a lawyer and sort things out
with CEO Oh's project.

00:48:04.715 --> 00:48:06.776
Don't.

00:48:06.776 --> 00:48:10.342
I don't want this to get any bigger.

00:48:11.170 --> 00:48:14.743
- Ji Soo.
- I'm scared.

00:48:38.021 --> 00:48:42.287
If this goes any further,
I feel like it's over for me.

00:48:43.087 --> 00:48:46.038
What if he blocks my career...

00:48:46.038 --> 00:48:49.784
and I never work again?

00:48:51.395 --> 00:48:54.754
Let's just stop here.

00:49:02.040 --> 00:49:06.287
Thank you for standing up for me, Sang Ah.

00:49:17.406 --> 00:49:21.632
You're not going back to that project, right?

00:49:24.097 --> 00:49:27.082
At least, if we cut the scenes
that weren't in the script,

00:49:27.082 --> 00:49:29.530
there aren't many shoot days left.

00:49:29.530 --> 00:49:34.246
I want to talk to him and just finish it.

00:49:39.945 --> 00:49:42.926
I'm worried

00:49:44.478 --> 00:49:47.424
this will happen again.

00:49:50.212 --> 00:49:53.638
How did it end up like this...

00:49:55.345 --> 00:49:59.125
I just wanted to be a great actress.

00:50:06.415 --> 00:50:09.294
Let's get stronger.

00:50:10.368 --> 00:50:13.901
Then no one can push us around.

00:50:27.886 --> 00:50:31.732
I heard Chu Sang Ah and Han Ji Soo

00:50:31.732 --> 00:50:36.465
had been inseparable since their debut...

00:50:36.465 --> 00:50:41.312
but to me, it felt like something more.

00:50:41.312 --> 00:50:43.899
It wasn't just friendship,

00:50:43.899 --> 00:50:46.671
it was love. Right?

00:50:49.191 --> 00:50:51.065
Back then,

00:50:51.065 --> 00:50:54.061
Chu Sang Ah didn't have
any real scandals with men,

00:50:54.061 --> 00:50:57.578
so I figured... maybe that was it.

00:50:57.578 --> 00:51:00.724
So she really lost it, huh?

00:51:00.724 --> 00:51:03.336
Over Han Ji Soo.

00:51:04.821 --> 00:51:08.262
No one in that world could go up

00:51:08.262 --> 00:51:11.681
against Oh Kwang Jae.

00:51:13.369 --> 00:51:16.828
But Chu Sang Ah started spiraling.

00:51:16.828 --> 00:51:18.806
And that spiral

00:51:18.806 --> 00:51:21.812
led to murder.

00:51:24.525 --> 00:51:27.411
So why did she

00:51:28.232 --> 00:51:32.071
want Oh Kwang Jae dead?

00:51:35.050 --> 00:51:37.689
What really happened

00:51:37.689 --> 00:51:40.277
[Chu Sang Ah Announces Hiatus
Following Han Ji Soo's Death]

00:51:40.277 --> 00:51:43.053
between them?

00:51:43.053 --> 00:51:46.679
[Chu Sang Ah Cast in Seeds of Tears]

00:51:48.648 --> 00:51:50.771
Han Ji Soo, Oh Kwang Jae...

00:51:50.771 --> 00:51:53.217
and Chu Sang Ah.

00:51:54.507 --> 00:51:57.437
Could there be more

00:51:57.437 --> 00:51:59.981
we don't know?

00:51:59.981 --> 00:52:02.938
[Han Ji Soo Found Dead at Home
in Apparent Suicide]

00:52:02.938 --> 00:52:05.987
[Han Ji Soo Pushes Boundaries
with Consecutive 19+ Roles]

00:52:14.313 --> 00:52:17.732
I think everything went wrong

00:52:18.332 --> 00:52:21.598
starting that night.

00:52:38.757 --> 00:52:41.363
Oh, Ji Soo.

00:52:42.523 --> 00:52:43.587
Sir.

00:52:43.587 --> 00:52:46.836
Long trip, huh? Come on in.

00:52:49.859 --> 00:52:51.649
We're filming today, right?

00:52:51.649 --> 00:52:55.056
I didn't see any of the crew.

00:53:07.811 --> 00:53:09.811
Sir.

00:53:09.811 --> 00:53:12.691
This isn't a shoot, is it?

00:53:12.691 --> 00:53:15.964
Something more important.

00:53:22.644 --> 00:53:24.848
Chairman, and Chief Prosecutor.

00:53:24.848 --> 00:53:26.659
Thank you for your patience.

00:53:26.659 --> 00:53:29.144
This is Han Ji Soo,
a new actress I just brought on.

00:53:29.144 --> 00:53:35.195
Great voice, and she really knows
how to use her body.

00:54:04.533 --> 00:54:06.846
Let go!

00:54:08.146 --> 00:54:09.977
Hey.

00:54:09.977 --> 00:54:12.519
Easy there.

00:54:12.519 --> 00:54:15.906
You almost hurt her.

00:54:15.906 --> 00:54:17.786
Ji Soo,

00:54:17.786 --> 00:54:21.033
are you okay?

00:54:21.033 --> 00:54:24.525
What is this...

00:54:24.525 --> 00:54:28.105
Just stay still. Don't make a scene.

00:54:28.105 --> 00:54:31.038
My apologies, Chairman.

00:58:21.949 --> 00:58:25.827
These are the pieces of evidence
found at the Oh Kwang Jae crime scene.

00:58:25.827 --> 00:58:29.442
I'll take the fall with you.

00:58:29.442 --> 00:58:32.653
What did you do to Ji Soo?

00:58:32.653 --> 00:58:35.220
If that gets out, we're finished.

00:58:35.220 --> 00:58:36.910
You're no different.

00:58:36.910 --> 00:58:39.110
My mistake was marrying a killer.

00:58:39.110 --> 00:58:41.247
You're the one who killed him.

00:58:41.247 --> 00:58:43.862
Even if you hadn't...

00:58:44.669 --> 00:58:47.936
Oh Kwang Jae was going to die anyway.